# Kiro Session Archives — never published
# ==============================================================================
# A kiro-session-*.zip is a complete conversation transcript. The one audited on
# 2026-09-02 held 32 username instances, 28 C:\Users paths and 15 base64-embedded
# SCREENSHOTS. Screenshots are not reviewable by any text scan, so whatever else
# was on screen ships with them. No credentials were found, but the point is that
# a grep cannot establish that for the image half.
#
# This lives in .gitignore rather than .git/info/exclude deliberately: the rule
# should travel to every clone and every future machine, and "we do not publish
# session archives" is not itself sensitive.
# See .kiro_artifacts/2026-09-02_public_repository_exposure_audit.md
.kiro_artifacts/*.zip
kiro-session-*.zip
